					"speakerTitle": "乌尔曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 726510202,
					"content": "什么「吸引仙灵体质」？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726510203
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 726510203,
					"content": "你是…旅行者？哎呀，你来得正好。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726510204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "乌尔曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 726510204,
					"content": "我有一桩大生意，好生意！能赚到成吨的摩拉，不知道你有没有兴趣…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726510205,
						726510206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "乌尔曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 726510205,
					"content": "那你自己为什么不去做？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726510207
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 726510207,
					"content": "你别这么警惕嘛，你看，我就是个想来稻妻发一笔财的普通人。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726510208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "乌尔曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 726510208,
					"content": "稻妻不是锁着国嘛，我就找几位好朋友想了想办法，弄了一艘小船，准备渡海来稻妻…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726510209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "乌尔曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 726510209,
					"content": "但是，唉…但是我越接近稻妻，天气就越怪，又是打雷，又是风暴…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726510210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "乌尔曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 726510210,
					"content": "然后，突然一道雷正巧劈在我的船上，船毁了，我也掉进了海里。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726510211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "乌尔曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 726510211,
					"content": "几个浪头拍过来，我喝了好几口水，人也晕了过去，再醒来的时候，就在海滩上趴着了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726510212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "乌尔曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 726510212,
					"content": "你运气可真好。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726510213
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 726510213,
					"content": "哈哈哈，那可不，我运气一向不错。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726510214
					],
					"speakerTitle": "乌尔曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 726510214,
					"content": "而且…呃…怎么说呢，我上岸之后四处打探了一下，结果…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726510215
					],
					"speakerTitle": "乌尔曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 726510215,
					"content": "就遇见了这小家伙。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726510216
					],
					"speakerTitle": "乌尔曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 726510216,
					"content": "仙、仙灵？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726510217
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 726510217,
					"content": "准确地来说，它叫做「寻宝仙灵」。顾名思义，就是那种能带着人找到宝藏的好伙伴。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726510218
					],
					"speakerTitle": "乌尔曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 726510218,
					"content": "但是不知道为什么，它带着我去寻了几处宝藏之后，突然就罢工了，只是一直跟在我身边转来转去…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726510219
					],
					"speakerTitle": "乌尔曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 726510219,
					"content": "我寻思，它也许是觉得我挖宝贝的速度太慢，想要换个合作伙伴了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726510220
					],
					"speakerTitle": "乌尔曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 726510220,
					"content": "旅行者，如果你有兴趣的话，你愿意来当这个合作寻宝的伙伴吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726510221
					],
					"speakerTitle": "乌尔曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 726510221,
					"content": "我不擅长和仙灵交流…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726510222
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 726510222,
					"content": "哈哈哈，没事没事，这小家伙好像还挺喜欢你的，你看它蹦跶得多欢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726510223
					],
					"speakerTitle": "乌尔曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 726510223,
					"content": "咳！不说这个，总之，你想试试和这小家伙合作吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726510224,
						726510225
					],
					"speakerTitle": "乌尔曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 726510224,
					"content": "我试试吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726510226
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 726510226,
					"content": "那太好了，我俩…不，我们三个，从现在开始就是合作关系了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726510227
					],
					"speakerTitle": "乌尔曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 726510227,
					"content": "这个本子你收好，这上面标记的地方都是可能埋有宝藏的地方。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726510228
					],
					"speakerTitle": "乌尔曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 726510228,
					"content": "没有「寻宝仙灵」帮忙，我是绝对找不到那些宝藏的…所以，就交给你了，旅行者。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726510229,
						726510231
					],
					"speakerTitle": "乌尔曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 726510229,
					"content": "找到宝藏后归谁？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726510230
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 726510230,
					"content": "这个嘛…找到宝藏后，里面的宝贝都归你，我分文不取。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726510233
					],
					"speakerTitle": "乌尔曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 726510233,
					"content": "但是你在挖宝藏的时候，也许有时候会发现「铁钱」…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726510234
					],
					"speakerTitle": "乌尔曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 726510234,
					"content": "如果你发现了「铁钱」的话，可以把这种古代钱币带来给我。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726510235
					],
					"speakerTitle": "乌尔曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 726510235,
					"content": "虽然一般的商人不会收这种东西，但我会出一个好价钱收购它们的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726510236
					],
					"speakerTitle": "乌尔曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 726510236,
					"content": "那么，这个本子你拿好，带上那个小家伙。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726510237
					],
					"speakerTitle": "乌尔曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 726510237,
					"content": "祝你寻宝愉快，同时嘛…也祝咱们合作愉快。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "乌尔曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 726510231,
					"content": "那些宝藏，你我五五开。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726510232
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 726510232,
					"content": "哟，没想到你还懂点规矩…咳，不过这些宝藏我就不拿了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726510233
					],
					"speakerTitle": "乌尔曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 726510225,
					"content": "希望它能喜欢我…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726510226
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 726510206,
					"content": "听起来就很可疑。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726510207
					]
				}
			]
		}
	]
}